/* App/Sources/Windows/Modules/TopProcessesSection.swift */
"\"Tutup\" meminta aplikasi menutup dengan sopan, jadi pekerjaanmu sempat disimpan. Pakai \"Tutup Paksa\" hanya kalau aplikasinya macet — pekerjaan yang belum disimpan bisa hilang." = "\"Quit\" asks the app to close politely, so your work has a chance to be saved. Use \"Force Quit\" only if the app is stuck — unsaved work may be lost.";
"\"Tutup\" mengirim SIGTERM (aplikasi sempat menyimpan pekerjaan). \"Tutup Paksa\" mengirim SIGKILL — langsung mati tanpa menyimpan. Proses milik sistem/root tidak bisa dihentikan tanpa privilege; proses yang dijaga launchd bisa hidup lagi — matikan agent-nya di Aplikasi Saat Login." = "\"Quit\" sends SIGTERM (the app gets a chance to save its work). \"Force Quit\" sends SIGKILL — it stops right away without saving. System/root processes can't be stopped without admin rights; processes kept alive by launchd may come back — turn off their agent in Login Apps.";
"%1$@ terus bekerja keras selama ±%3$d menit (rata-rata %2$d%% tenaga prosesor)" = "%1$@ has been working hard for about %3$d minutes (%2$d%% of processor power on average)";
"100% berarti satu inti prosesor penuh; aplikasi yang memakai beberapa inti bisa lebih dari 100%." = "100% means one full processor core; apps that use several cores can go above 100%.";
"Aplikasi yang paling banyak memakai memori. Tutup yang tidak sedang kamu pakai supaya Mac lebih lega." = "Apps that use the most memory. Quit the ones you're not using to give your Mac more room.";
"Aplikasi yang paling berat" = "Heaviest apps";
"Aplikasi yang sedang paling sibuk bekerja. Angkanya diperbarui sendiri setiap 2 detik." = "Apps that are working the hardest right now. The numbers update on their own every 2 seconds.";
"Beban CPU per proses, dihitung dari delta waktu CPU antar pembaruan (metrik yang sama dengan Activity Monitor), diperbarui otomatis tiap 2 detik. Status \"Not Responding\" hanya bisa dibaca lewat API privat — app yang macet justru turun ke 0%." = "CPU load per process, calculated from the change in CPU time between updates (the same measure Activity Monitor uses), updated automatically every 2 seconds. \"Not Responding\" status can only be read through private APIs — a stuck app actually drops to 0%.";
"Bukan lonjakan sesaat. Kalau kamu tidak sedang memakainya, sebaiknya ditutup." = "This isn't just a quick spike. If you're not using it, it's best to quit it.";
